// Weekly history is not exposed as a separate helper table.
// fnLoadSourceTable integrates history directly into the selected CSV table.
// It keeps current DATA-LAST rows and the latest WeeklyHistory file for each prior week.
// The resulting source table carries __SnapshotDate, __SnapshotDateTime,
// __SnapshotPeriod and __IsCurrent metadata.
// The authoritative implementation is generated by scripts/Build-SmartWorkplaceDashboard.js.
